===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|ambitransitive}} To form clusters or lumps.
# {{lb|en|ambitransitive}} To [[gather]] in dense groups.
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[walk]] with heavy [[footfall]]s.
# {{lb|en|transitive|UK|regional}} To [[strike]]; to [[beat]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1912|author=Mrs. Coulson Kernahan|title=The Go-Between|page=79
|passage=There is his poor little cap hanging up on the door; and there on the table is the knife he chipped a piece out of through not minding the mark on the knife machine, and I '''clumped''' his head for him, poor lamb!}}

